{"seq":3,"slug":"statutory-xml-submission","title":"法定格式报表生成与门户提交","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-seller-income-tax-reporting-dac7/annual-report-data-production/statutory-xml-submission","wordCount":1739,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"法定格式报表生成与门户提交\">法定格式报表生成与门户提交</h1><p>前两篇产出了一份口径正确的数据集，这一篇把它变成一份能被税务机关校验器接受的报文并提交出去。这一步看起来只是格式转换，实际包含了整条链路中最不可控的环节：外部 schema 的版本、门户的校验规则、提交失败的诊断、以及提交回执的留存。</p>\n<p>把报表生成与提交当作一个独立的、可重跑的作业来设计，而不是报表导出功能的一个分支，是这一篇的核心主张。理由是提交是有副作用的动作——一旦提交，就在税务机关留下了一次申报记录，重跑需要区分「重新生成」与「重新提交」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三层结构与两层职责\">核心概念：三层结构与两层职责</h2><p>报表生成可以切成三层，这样分层的原因是不同的变更频率。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>变更频率</th>\n<th>责任人</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>规范化层</td>\n<td>与法域无关的报送记录集</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>口径定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>映射层</td>\n<td>记录集 → 目标 schema 元素</td>\n<td>中（schema 版本变化）</td>\n<td>法域适配器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传输层</td>\n<td>报文封装、提交、回执</td>\n<td>高（门户变化）</td>\n<td>提交服务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>规范化层的输出是一组结构化的记录，每行是一个「卖家 × 报送期 × 季度 × 活动类型」的组合，包含金额、笔数、费用、预提和身份字段。这一层不包含任何 XML 或表单字段名，因此新增法域时它不变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dac7-报文的字段构成\">DAC7 报文的字段构成</h2><p>Annex V 第三节要求的报文包含两块信息：平台经营者信息与每个应报卖家的信息。平台经营者部分包含法定名称、注册地址、纳税人识别号/识别号、以及平台的商业名称。卖家部分按活动类型分成两个变体——非不动产出租使用一种字段结构，不动产出租使用另一种（含房源地址、土地登记号、出租天数、房产类型）。</p>\n<p>这一结构在实现上对应一个判别字段：<code>activity_type</code> 决定渲染哪个字段分支。英欧体系中这个判别在卖家级还是在记录级，取决于卖家是否同时从事两类活动——如果是，同一卖家会产生两条记录，分别按各自的分支渲染。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;ReportableSeller&gt;&#10;  &lt;SellerIdentity&gt;&#10;    &lt;LegalName&gt;Nordlicht Handel GmbH&lt;/LegalName&gt;&#10;    &lt;PrimaryAddress&gt;DE-20457 Hamburg&lt;/PrimaryAddress&gt;&#10;    &lt;TIN issuingState=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;DE4471•••••&lt;/TIN&gt;&#10;    &lt;BusinessRegistrationNumber&gt;HRB•••••&lt;/BusinessRegistrationNumber&gt;&#10;    &lt;VATNumber&gt;DE•••••&lt;/VATNumber&gt;&#10;  &lt;/SellerIdentity&gt;&#10;  &lt;RelevantActivities&gt;&#10;    &lt;ActivityType&gt;sale_of_goods&lt;/ActivityType&gt;&#10;    &lt;Quarter code=&quot;Q1&quot;&gt;&lt;Consideration currency=&quot;EUR&quot;&gt;4120.55&lt;/Consideration&gt;&lt;Count&gt;118&lt;/Count&gt;&lt;/Quarter&gt;&#10;    &lt;Quarter code=&quot;Q2&quot;&gt;&lt;Consideration currency=&quot;EUR&quot;&gt;5330.10&lt;/Consideration&gt;&lt;Count&gt;141&lt;/Count&gt;&lt;/Quarter&gt;&#10;    &lt;Quarter code=&quot;Q3&quot;&gt;&lt;Consideration currency=&quot;EUR&quot;&gt;4890.00&lt;/Consideration&gt;&lt;Count&gt;126&lt;/Count&gt;&lt;/Quarter&gt;&#10;    &lt;Quarter code=&quot;Q4&quot;&gt;&lt;Consideration currency=&quot;EUR&quot;&gt;6102.75&lt;/Consideration&gt;&lt;Count&gt;155&lt;/Count&gt;&lt;/Quarter&gt;&#10;    &lt;FeesAndTaxes&gt;&lt;PlatformFees currency=&quot;EUR&quot;&gt;1221.34&lt;/PlatformFees&gt;&lt;TaxWithheld currency=&quot;EUR&quot;&gt;0.00&lt;/TaxWithheld&gt;&lt;/FeesAndTaxes&gt;&#10;  &lt;/RelevantActivities&gt;&#10;&lt;/ReportableSeller&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">ReportableSeller</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">SellerIdentity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">LegalName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>Nordlicht Handel GmbH&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">LegalName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">PrimaryAddress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>DE-20457 Hamburg&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">PrimaryAddress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">TIN</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> issuingState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>DE4471•••••&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">TIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">BusinessRegistrationNumber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>HRB•••••&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">BusinessRegistrationNumber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">VATNumber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>DE•••••&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">VATNumber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">SellerIdentity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">RelevantActivities</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">ActivityType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>sale_of_goods&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">ActivityType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Quarter</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Q1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Consideration</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>4120.55&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Consideration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>118&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Quarter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Quarter</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Q2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Consideration</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>5330.10&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Consideration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>141&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Quarter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Quarter</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Q3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Consideration</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>4890.00&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Consideration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>126&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Quarter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Quarter</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Q4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Consideration</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>6102.75&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Consideration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>155&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">Quarter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">FeesAndTaxes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">PlatformFees</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>1221.34&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">PlatformFees</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">TaxWithheld</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>0.00&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">TaxWithheld</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">FeesAndTaxes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">RelevantActivities</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">ReportableSeller</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>这份骨架的字段名以各法域发布的技术规范为准，上例用于说明结构与层次，不代表任何具体 schema 的官方元素名。落地时必须以目标法域当期发布的技术规范为准，并把 schema 版本作为配置项而不是硬编码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"提交前的本地校验\">提交前的本地校验</h2><p>门户校验失败是最昂贵的一种失败：它发生在提交窗口的最后一天，需要人工诊断，而且诊断信息往往只有一行错误码。因此本地校验器应当是默认开启的一环，覆盖三类检查。</p>\n<p><strong>结构校验</strong>：必填元素存在、元素顺序符合 schema、数据类型正确。这类检查可以完全靠 schema 文件驱动，不需要手写规则。</p>\n<p><strong>业务校验</strong>：金额字段非负、身份字段无占位值、活动笔数与金额同时为空时应当报错。这类检查无法从 schema 得到，需要按业务规则实现。</p>\n<p><strong>一致性校验</strong>：报文中的金额与内部台账的对账差异为零或低于阈值；同一卖家在同一法域只出现一次（不动产出租分支出外）；报送期与当期一致；卖家身份键的归并粒度正确，见 <a href=\"multi-store-entity-merge-dedup\">多店铺多主体归并去重</a>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 提交前一致性检查：报文记录与内部台账的差异&#10;WITH reported AS (&#10;  SELECT seller_key, reportable_period, SUM(consideration_total) AS amt&#10;  FROM report_records WHERE batch_id = :batch_id&#10;  GROUP BY seller_key, reportable_period&#10;),&#10;ledger AS (&#10;  SELECT seller_key, reportable_period, SUM(consideration_total) AS amt&#10;  FROM quarterly_ledger_aggregates WHERE reportable_period = :period&#10;  GROUP BY seller_key, reportable_period&#10;)&#10;SELECT COALESCE(r.seller_key, l.seller_key) AS seller_key,&#10;       COALESCE(r.amt, 0) - COALESCE(l.amt, 0) AS variance&#10;FROM reported r&#10;FULL OUTER JOIN ledger l USING (seller_key, reportable_period)&#10;WHERE ABS(COALESCE(r.amt, 0) - COALESCE(l.amt, 0)) &gt; 0.01;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 提交前一致性检查：报文记录与内部台账的差异</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reported </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seller_key, reportable_period, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(consideration_total) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> report_records </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :batch_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seller_key, reportable_period</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ledger </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seller_key, reportable_period, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(consideration_total) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quarterly_ledger_aggregates </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reportable_period </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">period</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seller_key, reportable_period</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">seller_key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">seller_key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seller_key,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> variance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reported r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FULL OUTER JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ledger l </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (seller_key, reportable_period)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ABS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个查询返回任何非空行都意味着不应该提交。把「差异为零」作为提交前置门槛，比事后在门户报错里找原因的成本低一到两个数量级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"提交-回执与幂等\">提交、回执与幂等</h2><p>提交动作需要三个状态字段才能安全重跑：批次号、提交尝试记录、门户回执标识。缺少任何一个都会让重试变成重复申报。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant S as 提交服务&#10;    participant V as 本地校验器&#10;    participant P as 法域门户&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;V: 生成批次并校核&#10;    V--&gt;&gt;S: 校验通过 / 拒绝&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;P: 提交报文(带批次幂等键)&#10;    P--&gt;&gt;S: 回执(受理号 + 状态)&#10;    Note over S,P: 超时或网络异常时不得直接重发&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;P: 按幂等键查询提交状态&#10;    P--&gt;&gt;S: 已受理 / 未收到&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;S: 记录回执、状态、时间戳\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant S as 提交服务\n    participant V as 本地校验器\n    participant P as 法域门户\n    S-&gt;&gt;V: 生成批次并校核\n    V--&gt;&gt;S: 校验通过 / 拒绝\n    S-&gt;&gt;P: 提交报文(带批次幂等键)\n    P--&gt;&gt;S: 回执(受理号 + 状态)\n    Note over S,P: 超时或网络异常时不得直接重发\n    S-&gt;&gt;P: 按幂等键查询提交状态\n    P--&gt;&gt;S: 已受理 / 未收到\n    S-&gt;&gt;S: 记录回执、状态、时间戳</pre><p>图中标注的那一行是这一节的全部要点：提交超时不等于提交失败。在不知道门户是否已受理的情况下重发，会产生两笔申报，后续需要走撤回流程。正确做法是先按幂等键查询状态，确认未受理后再重发。提交后发现的错误走另一条路径，见 <a href=\"../seller-tax-doc-ops/reporting-quality-correction-penalty\">报送质量校验、更正申报与罚则</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"报送信息的卖家告知\">报送信息的卖家告知</h2><p>DAC7 体系下，平台除了向税务机关报送，还有一项独立义务：在同一个 1 月 31 日期限前，把报送的信息提供给应报卖家本人。英国第 4 条明确要求在同一期限前完成对卖家的信息提供（<a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2023/817/regulation/4/made\">SI 2023/817 regulation 4</a>）。</p>\n<p>这一义务常被遗漏，因为它在技术上只是一封通知，不是一次报文提交。但只要卖家没有在期限内收到信息，平台就处于违规状态，即使报文提交完全成功。工程上应当把它作为同一个批次的一个必要输出，与报文提交共用一个完成状态——缺了告知就不能把批次标记为完成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排除与豁免的申报处理\">排除与豁免的申报处理</h2><p>还存在一种容易被误实现的情况：平台认为应当由另一个平台经营者报送，从而不报某些卖家。英国规则允许这种豁免，但前提是必须在 1 月 31 日前通知 HMRC，说明依赖该豁免并提供另一经营者的规定信息（<a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2023/817/regulation/4/made\">SI 2023/817 regulation 4</a>）。</p>\n<p>这意味着「不报」是一个需要申报的动作，而不是省略。系统需要支持一个独立的输出：豁免通知，其内容包含被豁免卖家与承担报送义务的另一经营者。把豁免当作过滤条件直接丢掉卖家记录，是明确的违规。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>报表生成分三层：规范化层、映射层、传输层；映射层随 schema 版本变化，传输层随门户变化。</li>\n<li>Annex V 报文含平台经营者信息与卖家信息两块，卖家部分按活动类型分两个字段分支。</li>\n<li>本地校验覆盖结构、业务、一致性三类，其中「报文与台账差异为零」应作为提交前置门槛。</li>\n<li>提交必须带批次幂等键；超时不等于失败，须先按幂等键查询状态再决定是否重发。</li>\n<li>平台有独立的卖家告知义务，期限与报文提交相同，须纳入同一批次的完成判定。</li>\n<li>豁免另一经营者报送的情形需要单独提交豁免通知，不能在过滤条件里静默丢弃卖家记录。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"法定格式报表生成与门户提交","id":"法定格式报表生成与门户提交"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三层结构与两层职责","id":"核心概念-三层结构与两层职责"},{"level":2,"text":"DAC7 报文的字段构成","id":"dac7-报文的字段构成"},{"level":2,"text":"提交前的本地校验","id":"提交前的本地校验"},{"level":2,"text":"提交、回执与幂等","id":"提交-回执与幂等"},{"level":2,"text":"报送信息的卖家告知","id":"报送信息的卖家告知"},{"level":2,"text":"排除与豁免的申报处理","id":"排除与豁免的申报处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多店铺多主体归并去重","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-seller-income-tax-reporting-dac7/annual-report-data-production/multi-store-entity-merge-dedup"},"next":{"title":"W-9/W-8 系列自我声明收集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-seller-income-tax-reporting-dac7/seller-tax-doc-ops/w9-w8-certificate-collection"}}